DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44118::$$$message_0377_0000_0000$$$::"..."::
44119::$$$message_0377_0000_0001$$$::"AWWWW YEAHHHHHH!"[rf]::
44120::$$$message_0377_0001_0000$$$::"Goldy and Lancer down in one! Total victory to us, no complaints!"::
44121::$$$message_0377_0001_0001$$$::"That was incredible! BOOM! This is the moment when we transcended human history!"::
44122::$$$message_0377_0001_0002$$$::"What a bunch of pushovers."::
44123::$$$message_0377_0001_0003$$$::"I refuse to accept this![lr]::
44124::$$$message_0377_0001_0004$$$::I am humanity's King of Heroes, the oldest and greatest! This child's game is no true battle!"::
44125::$$$message_0377_0001_0005$$$::"Huh!? [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR7A_TIG_0040 _name=Ëó§„Å≠„Åà]No way, the dojo's disappearing![lr]::
44126::$$$message_0377_0001_0006$$$::That Goldy's turning as murderous as he was in the main story!"[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
44127::$$$message_0377_0001_0007$$$::"Ahhhh! It's bringing back my trauma from the other game!"::
44128::$$$message_0377_0002_0000$$$::"[hfangry layer=1]Master, my heart is throbbing again! This has to be love!"::
44129::$$$message_0377_0002_0001$$$::"Who needs love like that!?[lr]::
44130::$$$message_0377_0002_0002$$$::No time for that now! We're in trouble!"::
44131::$$$message_0377_0002_0003$$$::"Dang it, do I have no choice but to flip the Proton Switch I've been hiding inside my Tiger Bamboo Sword...!?"::
44132::$$$message_0377_0002_0004$$$::"Fool! Did you really think you could match my firepower!? You only had a chance because I tripped up first!"::
44133::$$$message_0377_0002_0005$$$::"Ahhhh! A new clear romance![lr]::
44134::$$$message_0377_0002_0006$$$::[hfwww layer=1]Whether Taiga or the gold man wins, Fuyuki's doomed!"::
44135::$$$message_0377_0002_0007$$$::"Time's up for mankind![lr]::
44136::$$$message_0377_0002_0008$$$::Die with me! DIEEEE!"::
44137::$$$message_0377_0002_0009$$$::"You just said the same thing twice![lr]::
44138::$$$message_0377_0002_0010$$$::Ahhhh! Someone heeelllp!"[nolr][p]::
44139::$$$message_0377_0002_0011$$$::"...Rrgh. Goodbye, me."[nolr][p]::
44140::$$$message_0377_0002_0012$$$::"...[hfsigh layer=0]Man, why do I always get mixed up in this shite?"::
44141::$$$message_0377_0002_0013$$$::"Lancer...? Are you here to save us?"::
44142::$$$message_0377_0002_0014$$$::"No one's saving anyone. If I leave this dimwit alone, he'll drag me into it, too. I'm just nipping this crisis in the bud."::
44143::$$$message_0377_0002_0015$$$::"Take it, lass. You win this round."::
44144::$$$message_0377_0002_0016$$$::"Are you sure...?[lr]::
44145::$$$message_0377_0002_0017$$$::If I take it, that means I really will have won the Holy Grail War."::
44146::$$$message_0377_0002_0018$$$::"Go ahead. My own creed is more important to me than the Holy Grail."::
44147::$$$message_0377_0002_0019$$$::"...Winners take and losers lose.[lr]::
44148::$$$message_0377_0002_0020$$$::[hfsigh layer=0]...I'm old-fashioned, you see. That's something I just can't hide."::
44149::$$$message_0377_0002_0021$$$::"Lancer, bro... You're such a good character this time. After the golden man. Hngh, my chest is getting all tight."::
44151::$$$message_0377_0003_0000$$$::"Eeek! Be careful, Lancer, you'll die! If you raise Illya's affection points any more, she'll kill you!"::
44152::$$$message_0377_0003_0001$$$::"Sure thing. Come by again and hang out if you're ever free."::
44153::$$$message_0377_0003_0002$$$::"But you need to wrap up your business, first."::
44154::$$$message_0377_0004_0000$$$::"Now, get going while he's spaced out. He said something about the summoning site being behind Ryudou Temple."::
44155::$$$message_0377_0005_0000$$$::"You've done us a favor, Lancer.[lr]::
44156::$$$message_0377_0005_0001$$$::We're going. Let's play again if we ever get a chance."::
44157::$$$message_0377_0005_0002$$$::"Farewell, brother! We'll be back someday to eat some of that fish you catch!"[nolr][p]::
44158::$$$message_0377_0005_0003$$$::"Sure thing. Godspeed.[lr]::
44159::$$$message_0377_0005_0004$$$::Now, what to do... I guess I'll think about it after I clean up here."[nolr][p]≠ÊÕ